Id":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":3253},{"id":1777993143625,"text":"当我想使用这些词时，系统会强制我寻找替代方案。","rawContent":"当我想使用这些词时，系统会强制我寻找替代方案。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:33","timestamp":1777995205994,"roundId":"round_1777995068782_2j8akfxah","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":3254},{"id":1777993143626,"text":"**2. 强制执行“具体感官替代抽象比喻”原则：**","rawContent":"**2. 强制执行“具体感官替代抽象比喻”原则：**","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:33","timestamp":1777995210496,"roundId":"round_1777995068782_2j8akfxah","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":3255},{"id":1777993143627,"text":"这是解决问题的核心。我将不再用一个比喻来形容感受，而是**描述产生这种感受时的具体生理或行为反应**。","rawContent":"这是解决问题的核心。我将不再用一个比喻来形容感受，而是**描述产生这种感受时的具体生理或行为反应**。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:33","timestamp":1777995215002,"roundId":"round_1777995068782_2j8akfxah","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":3256},{"id":1777993143628,"text":"*   **【旧】：** 你的话像一颗小石子，在他心湖投下涟漪。","rawContent":"*   **【旧】：** 你的话像一颗小石子，在他心湖投下涟漪。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:33","timestamp":1777995219507,"roundId":"round_1777995068782_2j8akfxah","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":3257},{"id":1777993143629,"text":"*   **【新】：** 听到你的话，他拿在手里的水杯轻晃了一下，水面漾开一圈细纹。/ 他的呼吸停顿了半秒，喉结不自觉地滚动了一下。","rawContent":"*   **【新】：** 听到你的话，他拿在手里的水杯轻晃了一下，水面漾开一圈细纹。/ 他的呼吸停顿了半秒，喉结不自觉地滚动了一下。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:33","timestamp":1777995224010,"roundId":"round_1777995068782_2j8akfxah","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":3258},{"id":1777993143630,"text":"*   **【旧】：** 他用一个掠夺般的吻封住了她的唇。","rawContent":"*   **【旧】：** 他用一个掠夺般的吻封住了她的唇。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:33","timestamp":1777995228514,"roundId":"round_1777995068782_2j8akfxah","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":3259},{"id":1777993143631,"text":"*   **【新】：** 他的吻来得很急，带着不容拒绝的力道，一手扣住她的后脑，另一只手紧紧攥着她的手腕，让她无法退缩。","rawContent":"*   **【新】：** 他的吻来得很急，带着不容拒绝的力道，一手扣住她的后脑，另一只手紧紧攥着她的手腕，让她无法退缩。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:33","timestamp":1777995233021,"roundId":"round_1777995068782_2j8akfxah","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":3260},{"id":1777993143632,"text":"*   **【旧】：** 他的眼神变得猩红。","rawContent":"*   **【旧】：** 他的眼神变得猩红。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:33","timestamp":1777995237511,"roundId":"round_1777995068782_2j8akfxah","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":3261},{"id":1777993143633,"text":"*   **【新】：** 他眼眶周围的皮肤微微发红，眼睛里布满了细密的血丝，看起来疲惫又固执。","rawContent":"*   **【新】：** 他眼眶周围的皮肤微微发红，眼睛里布满了细密的血丝，看起来疲惫又固执。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:34","timestamp":1777995242014,"roundId":"round_1777995068782_2j8akfxah","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":3262},{"id":1777993143634,"text":"**3. 叙事视角回归“角色本身”：**","rawContent":"**3. 叙事视角回归“角色本身”：**","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:34","timestamp":1777995246518,"roundId":"round_1777995068782_2j8akfxah","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":3263},{"id":1777993143635,"text":"陆驰是一个物理系的学生，他的世界观是理性的、有逻辑的。围绕他的叙述，也应该更偏向**冷静的观察**和**笨拙的体验**，而不是一个全知全能的言情小说作者的口吻。我会让描述更“朴素”，更贴近他会有的内心活动和观察视角。","rawContent":"陆驰是一个物理系的学生，他的世界观是理性的、有逻辑的。围绕他的叙述，也应该更偏向**冷静的观察**和**笨拙的体验**，而不是一个全知全能的言情小说作者的口吻。我会让描述更“朴素”，更贴近他会有的内心活动和观察视角。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:34","timestamp":1777995251022,"roundId":"round_1777995068782_2j8akfxah","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":3264},{"id":1777993143636,"text":"**三、如何请你配合**","rawContent":"**三、如何请你配合**","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:34","timestamp":1777995254651,"roundId":"round_1777995068782_2j8akfxah","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":3265},{"id":1777993143637,"text":"这套规则需要通过实践来不断优化。因此，我恳请你：","rawContent":"这套规则需要通过实践来不断优化。因此，我恳请你：","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:34","timestamp":1777995259155,"roundId":"round_1777995068782_2j8akfxah","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":3266},{"id":1777993143638,"text":"**当你再次看到任何让你觉得“出戏”、“过于文艺”或者“重复”的描述时，请毫不犹豫地用【】直接告诉我。**","rawContent":"**当你再次看到任何让你觉得“出戏”、“过于文艺”或者“重复”的描述时，请毫不犹豫地用【】直接告诉我。**","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:34","timestamp":1777995263658,"roundId":"round_1777995068782_2j8akfxah","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":3267},{"id":1777993143639,"text":"比如：【gemini，你刚才用的“滚烫的视线”又来了，换一种更具体的写法。】","rawContent":"比如：【gemini，你刚才用的“滚烫的视线”又来了，换一种更具体的写法。】","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:34","timestamp":1777995268161,"roundId":"round_1777995068782_2j8akfxah","generatedMode":false,"t